 an NBA assistant coach with the Blazers under Jack Ramsay. Adelman, who coached at Chemeketa Community College for the past six seasons, played for Portland from 1970-73.\n\nThe Clippers entered the game with Adelman's predecessor, Jim Lynam, as the newest Head Coach for the Clippers, replacing Paul Silas. Lynam was an assistant under Ramsay from 1981 until he was hired by the Clippers on June 8.\n\nIn addition, former Blazer players Bill Walton and Hank McDowell are on the active San Diego roster though Walton did not play. The Clippers have announced Walton will not play back-to-back nights and with the Clippers home opener tomorrow, the team chose to have him play in San Diego.\n\nDuring the preseason, the Clippers had former Blazers Bob Gross and Michael Harper on their roster, but both were released yesterday.", "aspectRatio": {"height": 1322, "width": 890}, "image": {"$type": "blob", "ref": {"$link": "bafkreigfryxirctburwjtdzxglccnoicu66dyvdfyrauetlv5yemo6sdpy"}, "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "size": 866264}}]}, "facets": [{"features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#tag", "tag": "RipCity"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 121, "byteStart": 113}}, {"features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#tag", "tag": "ThisDateinBlazersHistory"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 147, "byteStart": 122}}], "langs": ["en"], "text": "October 28, 1983 - Clyde Drexler made his NBA debut in the Blazers home victory against the San Diego Clippers.\n\n#RipCity #ThisDateinBlazersHistory"}, "embed": {"images": [{"thumb": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:ixcg2jfvljshf3p7jhmt77ee/bafkreigfryxirctburwjtdzxglccnoicu66dyvdfyrauetlv5yemo6sdpy", "fullsize": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:ixcg2jfvljshf3p7jhmt77ee/bafkreigfryxirctburwjtdzxglccnoicu66dyvdfyrauetlv5yemo6sdpy", "alt": "Drexler came off the bench, scoring 2 points, grabbing 2 rebounds, and added a steal and a blocked shot in 11 minutes of action. He attempted, and scored, his first field goal within the first minute of action.\n\nIn addition, Rick Adelman made his debut as an NBA assistant coach with the Blazers under Jack Ramsay. Adelman, who coached at Chemeketa Community College for the past six seasons, played for Portland from 1970-73.\n\nThe Clippers entered the game with Adelman's predecessor, Jim Lynam, as the newest Head Coach for the Clippers, replacing Paul Silas. Lynam was an assistant under Ramsay from 1981 until he was hired by the Clippers on June 8.\n\nIn addition, former Blazer players Bill Walton and Hank McDowell are on the active San Diego roster though Walton did not play. The Clippers have announced Walton will not play back-to-back nights and with the Clippers home opener tomorrow, the team chose to have him play in San Diego.\n\nDuring the preseason, the Clippers had former Blazers Bob Gross and Michael Harper on their roster, but both were released yesterday.", "aspectRatio": {"height": 1322, "width": 890}}], "$type": "app.bsky.embed.images#view"}, "bookmarkCount": 0, "replyCount": 0, "repostCount": 0, "likeCount": 0, "quoteCount": 0, "indexedAt": "2026-10-29T02:23:31.179Z", "labels": []}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:xts2ui2jxnfpijz2o6oixska/app.bsky.feed.post/3myy7ga4w5k2f", "cid": "bafyreicm46koibhowuhnxznkd7trpkcyielirvobwew4aguddsx2atctj4", "author": {"did": "did:plc:xts2ui2jxnfpijz2o6oixska", "handle": "kylie.hater.club", "displayName": "kylie, themeny of the state (festive),,,", "pronouns": "they/them", "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:xts2ui2jxnfpijz2o6oixska/bafkreib4qumnfcwgx57p53wrpuizqnpvfbal7w3drxmuandgn6p42iptmm", "associated": {"chat": {"allowIncoming": "following"}, "activitySubscription": {"allowSubscriptions": "followers"}}, "labels": [{"src": "did:plc:xts2ui2jxnfpijz2o6oixska", "uri": "at://did:plc:xts2ui2jxnfpijz2o6oixska/app.bsky.actor.profile/self", "cid": "bafyreigbpkxqqykgf2rykngf2elbntbna5e5v3qdvspxjppkl4umkjqply", "val": "!no-unauthenticated", "cts": "1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z"}], "createdAt": "20